                            displayMode="singleText"
                            elementNames="description"
                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/napa-wine-tasting/napa-wine-tasting"
                            paragraphScope="all"
                            text="Napa Wine Tasting A slow day in the Napa Valley The Napa Valley is fifty kilometres of vineyards an hour north of San Francisco, and its famous names can be crowded and formal. We go instead to three small, family-run wineries where the person pouring is often the person who made the wine. A driver takes care of the road, so everyone can taste."
                            variationName="master">
